c1479f03092","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ecadc2b94d58e0bc3ac4","layer":"pei","quote":"从破马超等，子伯功为多。曹公常叹曰：‘子伯之计，孤不及也","attribution":"裴注·《吴书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4d3d422b1c33b802fc46","start":363,"end":391,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e4c76a262233ce6e6ef6","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ecadc2b94d58e0bc3ac4","layer":"pei","quote":"刘表亡，曹公向荆州。表子琮降，以节迎曹公；诸将皆疑诈，曹公以问子伯。子伯曰：‘天下扰攘，各贪王命以自重；今以节来，是必至诚。’曹公曰：‘大善！’遂进兵","attribution":"裴注·《吴书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4d3d422b1c33b802fc46","start":257,"end":332,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-393b6ab4c03dbae03d80","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ad54538018c47a5ca636","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖性忌，有所不堪者；鲁国孔融，﹝五﹞南阳许攸、﹝六﹞娄圭，皆以恃旧不虔见诛〖18〗。﹝七﹞而琰，最为世所痛惜，至今冤之。﹝八﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-c57da63a683832dab73a","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-ecadc2b94d58e0bc3ac4","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝七﹞《魏略》曰：“娄圭字子伯，少与太祖有旧。初平中，在荆州北界合众，后诣太祖。太祖以为大将；不使典兵，常在坐席言议。及河北平定，随在冀州。其后太祖从诸子出游，子伯时亦随从。子伯顾谓左右曰：‘此家父子，如今日，为乐也。’人有白者，太祖以为有腹诽意，遂收治之。”《吴书》曰：“子伯少有猛志，尝叹息曰：‘男儿居世，会当得数万兵、千匹骑，著后耳！’侪辈笑之。后坐藏亡命，被系当死；得逾狱出，捕者追之急；子伯乃变衣服，如助捕者；吏不能觉，遂以得免。会天下义兵起，子伯亦合众，与刘表相依。后归曹公，遂为所用，军国大计常与焉。刘表亡，曹公向荆州。表子琮降，以节迎曹公；诸将皆疑诈，曹公以问子伯。子伯曰：‘天下扰攘，各贪王命以自重；今以节来，是必至诚。’曹公曰：‘大善！’遂进兵。宠秩子伯，家累千金，曰：‘娄子伯，富乐于孤，但势不如孤耳！’从破马超等，子伯功为多。曹公常叹曰：‘子伯之计，孤不及也！’后与南郡习授同载，见曹公出，授曰：‘父子如此，何其快耶！’子伯曰：‘居世间，当自为之！而但观他人乎？’授用白之，遂见诛。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4d3d422b1c33b802fc46","start":0,"end":454,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o089a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ed6c3abce1fb6b3e0309","layer":"original","quote":"太祖军到襄阳，琮举州降；备走奔夏口。﹝三﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":486,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1c8aa779ac389f7303e7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-dfd76f5cb0dc84d92f59","layer":"original","quote":"后超反，既从太祖破超于华阴","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-3c2e146e8eb20fe6cfbc","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2cd5dc7dbc155510ae63","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征荆州，琮举州降","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-52876f56216b11500e33","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-77cf8e238c8aa2ff298d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖破超于渭南，德随超亡入汉阳，保冀城","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":193,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-e521121329ff29a1cea8","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-2791e4960695e3d97a40","layer":"original","quote":"后数日会战，大破超等，褚身斩首级","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":132,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":99,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"surrender","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-031a374e9090ba29242f","quote":"九月，公到新野〖7〗，琮遂降。备走夏口〖8〗。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":663,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o121c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-031a374e9090ba29242f","layer":"original","quote":"九月，公到新野〖7〗，琮遂降。备走夏口〖8〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":663,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o132b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0f9191c7bec5bbb7c81","layer":"original","quote":"公乃与克日会战〖14〗，先以轻兵挑之。战良久，乃纵虎骑夹击〖15〗；大破之，斩成宜、李堪等。遂、超等走凉州〖16〗，杨秋奔安定〖17〗，关中平。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":237,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o024b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-modern","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-original","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
